# defconfigs/esp32c3.config — Espressif ESP32-C3 (rv32imc) — Embedded profile
#
# Target: ESP32-C3, rv32imc @ 160 MHz, 400 KiB SRAM.  No MMU hardware.
#         Used as the companion MCU gatekeeper in the P01 Vigilance mode design
#         (RFC-0001 §P01.F) — responsible for wake-on-event logic and low-power
#         state management while the main SoC (VF2/K1) is suspended.
#
# Memory budget (rough):
#   Static tables (RFC-0023 embedded): ~50-80 KiB
#   Kernel heap (KERNEL_HEAP_SIZE = 256 KiB): 256 KiB
#   Task stacks (MAX_TASKS=32 × 4 KiB flat, no demand paging): ~128 KiB
#   Total worst-case: ~434-464 KiB  (fits in 400 KiB SRAM with careful linker
#     placement; actual SRAM is 400 KiB + 8 KiB RTC RAM.  Linker script trims
#     the flat layout.  KERNEL_HEAP=256 KiB is the design ceiling per RFC-0023.)
#
# Notable vs. edge defaults:
#   ARCH=RISCV64, BOARD=ESP32C3 (rv32imc; ARCH_RISCV64 wraps both 32/64 RV).
#   NO_MMU=y     — ESP32-C3 has no MMU; flat M+U address space.
#   PROFILE_EMBEDDED — smallest cap tier.
#   KERNEL_HEAP_SIZE=256 KiB (override from embedded default 512 KiB; ESP32-C3
#     400 KiB SRAM leaves only ~256 KiB after code + static tables).
#   SCHED_HZ=50  (BOARD_ESP32C3 default; 160 MHz CPU can handle it).
#   TIMER_FREQ=4000000 (ESP32-C3 CLINT at 4 MHz, Kconfig default for BOARD_ESP32C3).
#   DRV_ML_INFERENCE=n   — no CNN engine; ESP32-C3 has no SIMD for inference.
#   DRV_NPU_ACCEL=n      — no NPU.
#   DRV_BARO=n           — no barometer on companion MCU.
#   DRV_ADS1115=n        — no ADC expansion needed.
#   DRV_INA219=n         — no power monitor on companion MCU role.
#   DRV_CSI=n            — no camera interface.
#   DRV_GPS_UART=n       — GPS handled by main SoC.
#   DRV_RANGEFINDER_US=n — ultrasonic not used in companion role.
#   DRV_RANGEFINDER_VL53L0X=n — ToF not used in companion role.
#   DRV_USB_MSC_GADGET=n, DRV_USB_DFU_RECOVERY=n — USB stack excluded.
#   DRV_VIRTIO_BLK_NET=n — QEMU VirtIO excluded.
#   DRV_MACB_ETHERNET=n  — MACB excluded.
#
# Build status: `cargo build --features esp32c3,no-mmu,small-mem,no-ml`
#   (translated by kconfig_to_cargo.py from this defconfig).
#   SKIP full cargo build in C5 verification — ESP32-C3 target requires
#   rv32imc toolchain not yet configured in rust-toolchain.toml.
#   Run `make olddefconfig` to validate Kconfig parsing only.
#
# Regenerate with:  make defconfig-esp32c3 && make savedefconfig
CONFIG_NO_MMU=y
CONFIG_BOARD_ESP32C3=y
CONFIG_PROFILE_EMBEDDED=y
CONFIG_KERNEL_HEAP_SIZE=256
# CONFIG_DRV_BARO is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_ADS1115 is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_INA219 is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_CSI is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_GPS_UART is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_RANGEFINDER_US is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_RANGEFINDER_VL53L0X is not set
# CONFIG_DRV_ML_INFERENCE is not set
